00:02:22.110 --> 00:02:23.550
won't change how much I love you."

00:02:23.550 --> 00:02:24.720
- [Kelly] Ugh.

00:02:24.720 --> 00:02:25.553
- [Zach] And what-

00:02:25.553 --> 00:02:26.386
- [Kelly] That was a huge, yeah.

00:02:26.386 --> 00:02:28.260
- [Zach] And this video
wasn't about the V word

00:02:28.260 --> 00:02:30.990
as much as it was about
unconditional love.

00:02:30.990 --> 00:02:31.823
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:02:31.823 --> 00:02:33.330
- At a time when we really
needed the connection.

00:02:33.330 --> 00:02:34.163
- Absolutely.

00:02:34.163 --> 00:02:35.010
- So it was very polarizing,

00:02:35.010 --> 00:02:36.930
but at that point it wasn't
about the polarization.

00:02:36.930 --> 00:02:38.783
I just wanted to bring people together.

00:02:38.783 --> 00:02:39.616
- [Kelly] Yeah, absolutely.

00:02:39.616 --> 00:02:40.598
- Yeah, that's how it started.

00:02:40.598 --> 00:02:41.520
- [Kelly] Love is love, I love that.

00:02:41.520 --> 00:02:43.980
Well, these moments
really are so powerful,

00:02:43.980 --> 00:02:46.710
